vdec - ARM6309-UV3, video card - vertical decodes and VBL
GAL22V10, 5892 fuses, checksum bf8e

  pin  signal      terms  of   path           polarity
  ---  ----------  -----  ---  -------------  ------------------
   16  VTC             2   12  combinational  pin follows terms
   17  BLANK           2   14  combinational  pin follows terms
   18  VBLANK         13   16  combinational  pin follows terms
   19  VSYNC          10   16  combinational  pin follows terms
   20  VSDLY           1   14  registered     pin follows terms
   21  VBLPEND         2   12  registered     pin follows terms
   22  IRQ             0   10  combinational  pin follows terms

  VSYNC: polarity is a function of VMODE[0] - graphics.md 6.2.1
  IRQ: open-drain by the OE idiom - the one OE term is spent

  7 outputs, 3 macrocells not driven.
